%N A398409 Decimal expansion of Sum_{k>=1} (-1)^(k+1) * H(k/2) / k^3, where H(x) is the harmonic number for the real value x.
%C A398409 See A074599 and A350670 for the value of H(x) at half integers.
%H A398409 Ali Shadhar Olaikhan, <a href="https://www.researchgate.net/publication/373488370">An Introduction to the Harmonic Series and Logarithmic Integrals</a>, 2nd ed., 2023, section 4.7.5, pp. 350-351, eq. (4.153).
%H A398409 Wikipedia, <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Harmonic_number#Harmonic_numbers_for_real_and_complex_values">Harmonic number: Harmonic numbers for real and complex values</a>.
%H A398409 <a href="/index/Ha#harmonic">Index entries for sequences related to harmonic numbers</a>.
%F A398409 Equals 39*zeta(4)/16 - 7*log(2)*zeta(3)/4 + log(2)^2*zeta(2)/2 - log(2)^4/12 - 2*Li_4(1/2).
